# NeolyxOS REOX SDK - toolchain locations
#
# This file is both `source`-able from a POSIX shell and `include`-able from
# GNU make (plain KEY=VALUE lines only; no `export`, no shell expansion).
#
# REOX_ROOT          Checkout of the REOX repository (consumed read-only; the
#                    REOX sources are NOT vendored into NeolyxOS).
# REOXC_HOST_PATH    reoxc built on the development host (cargo build --release
#                    in $REOX_ROOT/reox-lang).  Used today.
# REOXC_SYSTEM_PATH  reoxc as installed inside NeolyxOS.  Used once the
#                    toolchain ships in the system image.
# REOXC_MIN_VERSION  Oldest reoxc the SDK wrapper accepts.
#
# Override any of these from the environment or the make command line.
REOX_ROOT=/run/media/swa/Me/dev/OPenSource/REOX
REOXC_HOST_PATH=/run/media/swa/Me/dev/OPenSource/REOX/reox-lang/target/release/reoxc
REOXC_SYSTEM_PATH=/System/bin/reoxc
REOXC_MIN_VERSION=1.1.1
